  Description: Calls up a gate. When the cast ends, choose a Gate Stone you have discovered on the map, in any land you have visited; a portal then opens in front of you to it for a short while. Anyone may step through, and each traveller can return to where the gate was cast through the lit Gate Stone until the gate closes. Damage breaks the cast and the choice.
